{"text": "Hi! Welcome to HedgePredict. We check the top markets on Polymarket and point out where there could be true value. <break time=\"0.85s\" /> New to prediction markets? Each share pays a dollar if you're right. Buy at forty-three cents and win, and that's fifty-seven cents profit. The price is also the crowd's odds: about forty-three percent. <break time=\"0.85s\" /> More familiar with sportsbook odds? Flip the switch at the top, and every price turns into the odds you're familiar with. <break time=\"0.85s\" /> Here's the board: every market, its price, and HedgePredict's call. <break time=\"0.85s\" /> Every market gets one of three calls: Wager, Lean or Skip. Each one shows you how confident HedgePredict is. <break time=\"0.85s\" /> Then there's Hedge Lab, your own betting sandbox. Drop in the bets you're holding, and see every way your slip can land. Lock in what you can, size a bet to your bankroll, or play it all out a thousand times before you risk a dollar. <break time=\"0.85s\" /> Want the best pick without checking the board? Sign up for The Daily, our free newsletter. It sends the day's top pick to your inbox, weekday mornings. <break time=\"0.85s\" /> Don't see your pick on the board? Search all of Polymarket from the search bar, or ask HedgePredict anything about any market. <break time=\"1.3s\" /> You can also connect HedgePredict to Claude, ChatGPT, or any AI tool through our M C P. Paste one link, then just ask. <break time=\"1.0s\" /> So that's HedgePredict: you bring the plan, and we'll help you spot the value the market might be missing. Play smart, and go get 'em!", "alignment": {"characters": [" ", "H", "i", "!", " ", "W", "e", "l", "c", "o", "m", "e", " ", "t", "o", " ", "H", "e", "d", "g", "e", "P", "r", "e", "d", "i", "c", "t", ".", " ", "W", "e", " ", "c", "h", "e", "c", "k", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "t", "o", "p", " ", "m", "a", "r", "k", "e", "t", "s", " ", "o", "n", " ", "P", "o", "l", "y", "m", "a", "r", "k", "e", "t", " ", "a", "n